PositionFactory::setApprovedSwapTarget(address,bool)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when swapTarget is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryZeroAddress
    ├── when approvedSwapTarget already equals approved
    │   └── it should return without updating state or emitting
    └── when approval status changes
        ├── it should set approvedSwapTarget[swapTarget]
        └── it should emit ApprovedSwapTargetSet
